Package: gvoltools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-paramiko, python3-cryptography
Suggests: openssh-client
Description: SSH management and system administration tools
 GvolTools is a collection of utilities for managing SSH connections,
 host inventories, and system administration tasks across multiple
 Linux systems.
 .
 Features include:
  * SSH key management with encrypted storage
  * Host inventory with metadata and selection
  * SSH profile management and config generation
  * Remote command execution across host groups
  * System auditing and security checks
  * Certificate and firewall management
  * Log analysis and backup management
